OL,3,GNEWSAParking fines cause concern for
OL,4,Alocal business
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a children's soft play
OL,7,Farea in Lancing says they are losing
OL,8,Fout on business because of a
OL,9,F"scandalous" new parking system.
OL,11,FAndy McCarthy, owner of Space Station
OL,12,FSoft Play in Chartwell Business Centre,
OL,13,Fsaid more than 400 of his customers had
OL,14,Fbeen hit with #100 parking fines since
OL,15,Fthe introduction of a new automatic
OL,16,Fnumber plate recognition (ANPR) system
OL,17,Fin September.
OL,19,FHe said spaces that used to be free to
OL,20,Fuse were now blocked by the new system,
OL,21,Fand unclear signage and a lack of a
OL,22,Fgrace period had caught customers out.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
