OL,3,GNEWSAParking fines cause concern for
OL,4,Alocal business
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne Parking Solution, which is
OL,7,Fresponsible for parking management at
OL,8,Fthe centre, says the system is in place
OL,9,Fto "ensure safety and access".
